
## API Endpoints Reference

### Movies (Pelicula)
| Endpoint | Method | Description | Authentication |
|----------|--------|-------------|----------------|
| /api/peliculas | GET | List all movies | None |
| /api/peliculas/{id} | GET | Get movie details | None |
| /api/peliculas | POST | Add new movie | Admin |
| /api/peliculas/{id} | PUT | Update movie | Admin |
| /api/peliculas/{id} | DELETE | Delete movie | Admin |
| /api/peliculas/{id}/showtimes | GET | Get showtimes for movie | None |

